    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your enemies with countless combinations of weapons which you'll loot like crazy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three different pilots and level up their skilltrees to create your ultimate Spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Newgame+ where you will face increasingly stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your components\u00a0 with the Overclock function to keep your favourite weapons tuned for destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Three Pilot Classes with three skilltrees each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10 ships to choose from from light ships to the Titan assault ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple weapon systems like missiles, cannons and laser and more exotic weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique weapons for each category, funny weapons like the banana thrower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Different game modes ranging from stealth data delivery to boss fights</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your enemies with countless combinations of weapons which you'll loot like crazy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three different pilots and level up their skilltrees to create your ultimate Spaceship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Newgame+ where you will face increasingly stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your components\u00a0 with the Overclock function to keep your favourite weapons tuned for destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Three Pilot Classes with three skilltrees each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-10 ships to choose from from light ships to the Titan assault ship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Multiple weapon systems like missiles, cannons and laser and more exotic weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Unique weapons for each category, funny weapons like the banana thrower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Different game modes ranging from stealth data delivery to boss fights</p>",
    "short_description": "A blend between Shoot'em ups and Looter Shooters. Take on the story or randomly generated missions to level up your pilot and collect loot to build your ships up to take on bigger challenges.",
